# Campaign folders: only the analysis inputs (data.npz, one per flight) and the
# result tables (tables/*.csv, tables/*.tex) are tracked. Figures, per-run PNGs and
# raw GenoM logs are regenerated by the scripts or archived outside git.
*.png
*.pdf
*.log
# LaTeX build files of the TikZ sources
*.aux
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
